 "premise": "In 1863 Kyoto, after her family is killed, Tominaga Sei disguises herself as a boy named Kamiya Seizaburo and joins the Mibu-Roshi, later the Shinsengumi, both to serve and to avenge her family. Swordsman Okita Soji discovers her secret and keeps it if she proves herself a warrior. The long historical drama follows real people and events with a slow, restrained romance.",
 "life_message": "A good life is wholehearted loyalty and courage in service of one's comrades and calling, whatever others expect of you.",
